## Execution
Runs: batch

Only plan drafting and input inspection occur before approval. After approval, source the workspace's `_system/gars-env.sh` in `scripts/submit.sh` and invoke the analysis with `$GARS_PY`. Submit through `python3 <workspace>/_system/executorlib.py submit --workspace <project> <analysis>/scripts/submit.sh`, using the project's configured executor. Request 1 CPU, 4 GB RAM and 10 minutes; expected compute time is under 5 minutes for six samples, excluding queue time, with outputs under 10 MB. Capture stdout/stderr within this analysis directory. Missing dependencies, failed input validation or numerical failures stop the analysis and are reported without a silent retry or method change.
